# 统一换行符：仓库内一律使用 LF，避免 Windows / macOS 之间来回转换产生噪音
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理脚本必须保持 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析会出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做任何换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
